        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, logs, softwood, 6kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, logs, softwood, 6kW
Inventory refers to the production of a logs furnace 6kW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current logs furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTechnology: average technology\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_logs_6kW_v0.3_gr_lwa.xml\n\n
UUID: b21a1790-7785-3f7d-8373-8a14d94d5500
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b21a1790-7785-3f7d-8373-8a14d94d5500.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
